{"book":"isaiah","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T22:32:08.615020120Z","verse":1,"ref":"isaiah 33:1","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":33,"translation":"Woe ⟨to⟩ the destroyer, and you were not destroyed; ⟨to⟩ the traitor, and they did not deal treacherously with ⟨you⟩! When you finish destroying, you will be destroyed; when you finish dealing treacherously, they will deal treacherously against you.","tokens":[{"surface":"הוי","gloss":"Woe"},{"surface":"שודד","gloss":"the destroyer"},{"surface":"ואתה","gloss":"and you"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"שדוד","gloss":"destroyed"},{"surface":"ובוגד","gloss":"and the traitor"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"and not"},{"surface":"בגדו","gloss":"did they deal treacherously"},{"surface":"בו","gloss":"with him"},{"surface":"כהתמך","gloss":"when you finish"},{"surface":"שודד","gloss":"destroying"},{"surface":"תושד","gloss":"you will be destroyed"},{"surface":"כנלתך","gloss":"when you finish"},{"surface":"לבגד","gloss":"dealing treacherously"},{"surface":"יבגדו","gloss":"they will deal treacherously"},{"surface":"בך","gloss":"against you"}]}